      "id": "manage-reactions",
      "intro": "Reactions adalah aksi yang dijalankan setelah rule mendeteksi fraud. Misalnya: mengirim email, memblokir transaksi, atau mengirim notifikasi ke tim.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Apa Itu Reactions?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Email** — Kirim notifikasi ke tim fraud\n• **Block Transaction** — Blokir transaksi otomatis\n• **API Call** — Panggil webhook/API eksternal\n• **SMS** — Kirim SMS ke petugas\n• Reactions diatur per rule, tidak global",
          "color": "#ec4899",
          "bg": "#fdf2f8",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fbcfe8;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#fdf2f8;border:1px solid #f9a8d4;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#be185d;\">📧 Email</span><span style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#dc2626;\">🚫 Block Transaction</span><span style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#2563eb;\">🔗 API Call</span><span style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#16a34a;\">📱 SMS</span></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Menambah Reactions",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Saat mengedit rule, cari bagian **Reactions**\n• Klik **+ Tambah Reaction**, pilih jenis\n• Atur parameter (email tujuan, URL API, nomor SMS, dll)\n• Satu rule bisa punya beberapa reactions",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
